      "updated": 1777790000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1️⃣ User submits login → Frontend POST /api/auth/login → 2️⃣ Router → 3️⃣ AuthMiddleware (JWT) → 4️⃣ AuthHandler\n   → 5️⃣ AuthService validates → 6️⃣ Repository queries DB → 7️⃣ JWT created → 8️⃣ Cookie returned → 9️⃣ Frontend updates Context → 🔟 Redirect to Home",
