      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FOLLOW: POST /api/follow/:id → Insert followers (status=pending if private profile)\n\nACCEPT: PUT /api/follow/:id/accept → Update status to 'accepted'\n\nFETCH: GET /api/users/:id/followers → Query followers table\n\nPRIVATE: If profile is private → require status='accepted' to view posts",
