      "seed": 1000066,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1000066,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777790000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Frontend Button Click\n    ↓\nfetch('/api/posts', { method: 'POST', headers: { Authorization: 'Bearer JWT' } })\n    ↓\nAPI Route (Gin Router) - POST /api/posts\n    ↓\nMiddleware Chain: CORS → AuthMiddleware (JWT) → RateLimit → Validator\n    ↓\nHandler (PostHandler.CreatePost) - Extract user_id from context\n    ↓\nService (PostService.CreatePost) - Business logic, validation\n    ↓\nRepository (PostRepository.InsertPost) - SQL query to database\n    ↓\nDatabase (SQLite) - INSERT INTO posts ... → Return created post\n    ↓\nResponse back → 201 Created with post object\n    ↓\nFrontend receives response → Update PostsContext state → UI re-renders",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
